
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
CSCreationClassName                	string              	Read      
CSName                             	string              	Read      
Caption                            	string              	Read      
CommandLine                        	string              	Read      
CreationClassName                  	string              	Read      
CreationDate                       	datetime            	Read      
Description                        	string              	Read      
ExecutablePath                     	string              	Read      
ExecutionState                     	uint16              	Read      
Handle                             	string              	Read      
HandleCount                        	uint32              	Read      
InstallDate                        	datetime            	Read      
KernelModeTime                     	uint64              	Read      
MaximumWorkingSetSize              	uint32              	Read      
MinimumWorkingSetSize              	uint32              	Read      
Name                               	string              	Read      
OSCreationClassName                	string              	Read      
OSName                             	string              	Read      
OtherOperationCount                	uint64              	Read      
OtherTransferCount                 	uint64              	Read      
PageFaults                         	uint32              	Read      
PageFileUsage                      	uint32              	Read      
ParentProcessId                    	uint32              	Read      
PeakPageFileUsage                  	uint32              	Read      
PeakVirtualSize                    	uint64              	Read      
PeakWorkingSetSize                 	uint32              	Read      
Priority                           	uint32              	Read      
PrivatePageCount                   	uint64              	Read      
ProcessId                          	uint32              	Read      
QuotaNonPagedPoolUsage             	uint32              	Read      
QuotaPagedPoolUsage                	uint32              	Read      
QuotaPeakNonPagedPoolUsage         	uint32              	Read      
QuotaPeakPagedPoolUsage            	uint32              	Read      
ReadOperationCount                 	uint64              	Read      
ReadTransferCount                  	uint64              	Read      
SessionId                          	uint32              	Read      
Status                             	string              	Read      
TerminationDate                    	datetime            	Read      
ThreadCount                        	uint32              	Read      
UserModeTime                       	uint64              	Read      
VirtualSize                        	uint64              	Read      
WindowsVersion                     	string              	Read      
WorkingSetSize                     	uint64              	Read      
WriteOperationCount                	uint64              	Read      
WriteTransferCount                 	uint64              	Read      

